{
  "schema": "lscan-007 local OpenAI-compatible runtime conformance recipes. The scanner CONNECTS to an already-running local server; it never downloads or loads weights. Each recipe records the OpenAI-compatible base path, auth mode, model-identifier handling and loopback support so mocked protocol controls establish exactly which checks run.",
  "runtimes": {
